[] I need some help here, people.  What the heck do you do with statues???
[] One of the previous players who died on our nethack at MSU was a statue
[] instead of a ghost.  Is there any way to bring him to life?

occasionally statues are named for players who appear in the top ten
list, not necessarily related to the way they died.  this has no
connection whatsoever with the concept of a bones level.  statues do,
indeed, sometimes come to life but you cannot force a statue of
a previous player to come to life (unless it was meant to happen).

if you can get inside the statue, you might find a spellbook but
this happens so rarely that it is not worth worrying about, IMO ...

